      "instance_name": "Queensland",
      "label": "Queensland",
      "description": "Queensland is another state in Australia, known for its distinct cultural identity, strong sporting traditions (especially rugby league and cricket), and sometimes perceived regional rivalry with NSW. The meme targets Queensland directly with an abusive message, leveraging the real-world context of Australian state rivalries to heighten the meme's impact.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
